  "slug": "diminutivo-cito",
  "titulo": "The diminutive suffix -cito, -cita with words ending in -e, -n and -r",
  "subtitulo": "Fuentecita, camioncito, amorcito: small, and often affectionate.",
  "foto": "t04.jpg",
  "regla": "Words ending in -e, -n or -r usually take -cito / -cita / -citos / -citas: calle → callecita, camión → camioncito, amor → amorcito.",
